<title>ISRAEL: Clal Industries Q4 net loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Clal Industries Q4 net loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Clal Industries Ltd, a subsidiary of Clal Israel Ltd.</p>
<p>			  (in thousands of shekels except per share)</p>
<p>			  Q4 96	Q4 95     12-MTH 96  12-MTH 95</p>
<p>Sales and services  799,205    733,649   2,928,719  2,834,604</p>
<p>Pretax profit	  45,598     60,046     187,057    387,921</p>
<p>Net Profit	loss 14,652     43,070     78,725     246,256</p>
<p>EPS		 loss 0.10	 0.31	 0.56	 1.77</p>
<p>($1=3.25 shekels on Dec 31)</p>
<p>-Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
